from (values
  ('7abb7da7-5f92-4c60-8e51-44cc5c9a06e8', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-02'::date, '- Therapy today A lot came up I''m still sitting with it
- There''s this feeling where the afternoon stretches and nothing needs to happen I want more of that
- Got some good news today that I''m not ready to share yet
- Everyone at work seems to have it figured out and I''m just.. here
- I don''t have a good answer to this one today', 'private', 68, '2026-04-02T02:16:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-02T03:16:00+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('3a769779-885d-4a16-8013-b0faa226e126', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-03'::date, 'This one''s hard My hands smell like garlic and I''m happy I think the answer is just: sleep more It''s always sleep more Had the kind of conversation where you lose track of time More of those please I''ve been avoiding my inbox like it''s going to bite me Spent way too long on my phone tonight Not great I''ve been walking more and it actually helps, which is annoying because everyone said it would I called my mom today and it was nice, we didn''t fight about anything ok bye', 'community', 91, '2026-04-03T01:29:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-03T01:29:24+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('8de9ac70-9e14-478d-ab2b-bfc53854df05', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-05'::date, 'Not sure where to start Made suop Felt like a real adult for about forty minutes Got some good news today that I''m not ready to share yet I''ve been avoiding my inbox like it''s going to bite me I think I''ve been lonely and calling it independence', 'private', 48, '2026-04-05T03:50:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-05T09:39:00+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('a0493196-6a62-4301-b9d4-ff5a4eae97b3', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-06'::date, 'Hm I keep starting things and not finishing them Maybe that''s fine? Maybe the starting is the point I keep replaying a dumb thing I said in a meeting Nobody else remembers it, I''m sure Something about rain makes everything feel allowed There''s this feeling where the afternoon stretches and nothing needs to happen I want more of that I think I''ve been lonely and calling it independence I think the answer is just: sleep more I''ts always sleep more Today I just did the next thing, and then the next thing That was enough I don''t really know what I want right now and that scares me less than it used to 😮‍💨', 'private', 114, '2026-04-06T02:25:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-06T02:25:25+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('89ea1e41-0dd6-4e89-9e0a-1bf312f9d76a', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-07'::date, 'Lunch break entry I called my mom today and it was nice, we didn''t fight about anything 😮‍💨', 'private', 18, '2026-04-07T04:04:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-07T04:04:08+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('7ce64184-76fb-46d6-8305-6d8b87cdcbce', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-09'::date, 'Morning coffee, quiet house I read on the train instead of scrolling and felt like a different person Goodnight', 'private', 19, '2026-04-09T02:39:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-09T02:39:06+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('b899f2e7-fb84-44d1-b4d6-8d5ab91d35b6', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-10'::date, 'busy busy busy', 'private', 3, '2026-04-10T03:08:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-10T03:08:23+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('14f3570c-7c3a-4f5b-9b7d-49c6b2a6c2f8', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-14'::date, 'I almost skipped today Something about rain makes everything feel allowed Work has been a lot lately and I don''t think I''ve admitted that to anyone I signed up for a pottery class!! terrified!! I think I''m proud of how I handled the thing with my roommate The dog woke me up at 5 and honestly the sunrise was worth it I don''t have a good answer to this one today I finally finished that book The ending wrecked me Grateful, I guess', 'community', 83, '2026-04-14T02:23:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-14T02:23:09+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('fed1e545-3067-4fc0-9283-2fa4947d0e66', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-15'::date, 'fine', 'private', 1, '2026-04-15T02:23:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-15T02:23:10+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('e6882a10-5f69-4891-91c4-4e3757928b14', '556260ff-cda2-44c9-a1f4-21343c198e2b', '2026-04-17'::date, 'Long day I''ve been avoiding my inbox like it''s going to bite me I''ve been walking more and it actually helps, which is annoying because everyone said it would My sister is having a baby in December and I can''t stop thinking about it Everyone at work seems to have it figured out and I''m just.. here The dog woke me up at 5 and honestly the sunrise was worth it Therapy today A lot came up I''m still sitting with it I think I''m proud of how I handled the thing with my roommate I read on the train instead of scrolling and felt like a different person I cried in the car for no reason and then felt better Bodies are weird I think I''ve been lonely and calling it independence I signed up for a pottery class!! terrified!! …', 'community', 142, '2026-04-17T01:05:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-04-17T10:57:00+00:00'::timestamptz),
